{"id":147,"name":"dratini","speciesId":147,"dex":147,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["dragon"],"stats":{"hp":41,"attack":64,"defense":45,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":50,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"shed-skin","hidden":false},{"name":"marvel-scale","hidden":true}],"height":18,"weight":33,"baseExp":60,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/147.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/147.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/147.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/147.ogg","genus":"Dragon Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Dragão","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Long considered a mythical POKéMON until recently when a small colony was found living underwater."},{"version":"yellow","text":"The existence of this mythical POKéMON was only recently confirmed by a fisherman who caught one."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is born large to start with. It repeatedly sheds its skin as it steadily grows longer."},{"version":"silver","text":"This POKéMON is full of life ener­ gy. It continually sheds its skin and grows steadily larger."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It sheds many lay­ ers of skin as it grows larger. Dur­ ing this process, it is protected by a rapid waterfall."},{"version":"ruby","text":"DRATINI continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A DRATINI continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels."},{"version":"firered","text":"Even the young can exceed 6.5 feet in length. It grows larger by repeatedly shedding skin."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Long considered a mythical POKéMON until recently, when a small colony was found living underwater."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"This Pokémon is full of life energy. It continually sheds its skin and grows steadily larger."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dratini continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels."},{"version":"sun","text":"It grows by molting repeatedly. Boots made from the tanned cast-off skin are a super luxury item."},{"version":"moon","text":"After a 10-hour struggle, a fisherman was able to pull one up and confirm its existence."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s still weak, so it lurks on the floor of bodies of water, eating whatever food sinks down and living a quiet life."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sheds its skin—almost on a daily basis—and grows larger. Its skin is soft just after it’s been shed."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Long thought to be a myth, this Pokémon’s existence was only recently confirmed by a fisherman who caught one."},{"version":"sword","text":"Dratini dwells near bodies of rapidly flowing water, such as the plunge pools of waterfalls. As it grows, Dratini will shed its skin many times."},{"version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon was long considered to be no more than a myth. The small lump on a Dratini’s forehead is actually a horn that’s still coming in."}],"flavorPt":"Este Pokémon foi considerado por muito tempo nada mais que um mito. O pequeno caroço na testa de um Dratini é na verdade um chifre que ainda está aparecendo.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["water1","dragon"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"dratini","speciesId":147,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 30"],"species":"dragonair","speciesId":148,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 55"],"species":